       "text": "$2$",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Substitute $x_0=2$ into the iteration: $x_1=3(2)-1=5$."
    },
    {
     "id": "0e012ebd-d351-4a99-bda0-cf1f374d518f",
     "prompt": "Starting with $x_0=1$, use $x_{n+1}=\\frac{4}{x_n+1}$ three times. What is $x_3$ to 3 d.p.?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "$1.333$",
