       "text": "$1.714$",
       "correct": true
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "The values are $x_1=2$, $x_2=\\frac{4}{3}$ and $x_3=\\frac{4}{\\frac{4}{3}+1}=\\frac{12}{7}\\approx1.714$."
